*POTCAR*
calculations/lammps/dumps/*
*__pycache__*
*.venv
*.claude
jobs/pipeline/lammps_to_analysis/submit_pipeline.conf
jobs/pipeline/lammps_to_temperature_sweep/submit_temperature_sweep.conf
NAS/pipeline/manifests/
NAS/pipeline/logs/

# Generated output: numeric dumps, run logs, trajectories, tables and figures.
# All of it is regenerated by whatever wrote it, so none of it belongs in the
# history. Configuration that scripts read at runtime is named .config instead,
# so it is not caught by these.
*.dat
*.log
*.csv
*.png
*.lammpstrj

# LAMMPS data files: structures written by setup scripts and write_data.
*.data
analysis/shock/etc/test_output/

# Exception: starting-structures/ holds reference inputs, not output. Kept last
# so it overrides every pattern above (*.data included) for anything in there.
!starting-structures/**
